OL,3,GNEWSATrial date set for man accused of
OL,4,Amurdering wife
OL,5,
OL,6,FA trial date has been set for a man
OL,7,Fcharged with murdering his wife at
OL,8,Ftheir home in Horncastle.
OL,10,FMohammad Raees Mohammad Rahim, 34, of
OL,11,FWarwickshires Way, is accused of
OL,12,Fkilling 27-year-old Khyali Jana Rahim
OL,13,FBad Shah at the same address.
OL,15,FLincolnshire Police were called to the
OL,16,Fhouse on 2 April and found her
OL,17,Funconscious. She was later pronounced
OL,18,Fdead at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
