OL,3,GNEWSATrial date set for man accused of
OL,4,Amurdering wife
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe murder charge was not put to Rahim
OL,7,Fduring the hearing at Lincoln Crown
OL,8,FCourt on Monday and he was remanded in
OL,9,Fcustody until his next court
OL,10,Fappearance. The trial was listed at the
OL,11,Fsame court with a provisional start
OL,12,Fdate of 2 November and is expected to
OL,13,Flast two weeks.
